      "code": "class Point {\n  final int x;\n  final int y;\n\n  Point(this.x, this.y);                       // 简写：参数直接赋给字段\n  Point.origin() : x = 0, y = 0;               // 命名构造器\n  Point.fromJson(Map<String, int> m)\n      : x = m['x']!, y = m['y']!;              // 初始化列表\n\n  factory Point.parse(String s) {              // 工厂构造器：可以不返回新实例\n    final parts = s.split(',');\n    return Point(int.parse(parts[0]), int.parse(parts[1]));\n  }\n\n  const Point.constant(this.x, this.y);        // const 构造器：能当编译期常量\n}\n\nvar p1 = Point(1, 2);\nvar p2 = Point.origin();\nvar p3 = Point.parse('3,4');\n\n// ⚠ 命名构造器**不会被子类继承**\n// 初始化列表在构造器体之前跑，适合算 final 字段\nclass Color extends Point {\n  Color(int v) : super(v, v);                  // 用 super(...) 转发\n}",
